{"_id":"69e2adac91795ff59a3ed6f8","title":"Multyhub silent aim inf storage esp and more","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d7f","gameId":863266079,"name":"Apocalypse Rising 2","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/011c2a8c7949dfb1bca8f09e3ea140cac749c23570e8b995d596e158905289e9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-000d30d3e6dc41038f05b0a1a55692bd/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"863266079-apocalypse-rising-2","path":"/game/863266079-apocalypse-rising-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/011c2a8c7949dfb1bca8f09e3ea140cac749c23570e8b995d596e158905289e9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-000d30d3e6dc41038f05b0a1a55692bd/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":863266079},"slug":"Apocalypse-Rising-2-Multyhub-silent-aim-inf-storage-esp-and-more-202200","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":11586,"executes":2457,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/15d8fde2745364a3942a6958d8226507d617f0c705fffc94d4d8d5a32e3c7af1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/863266079-1776463276694.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/863266079-1776463276694.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/15d8fde2745364a3942a6958d8226507d617f0c705fffc94d4d8d5a32e3c7af1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/863266079-1776463276694.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/863266079-1776463276694.png"},"likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-04-17T22:01:16.732Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-17T22:01:16.732Z","lastBump":"2026-04-17T22:01:16.732Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/multyplyy/multyHubLoader/main/loader.luau\"))()","features":"Features\n\n70 features across 7 categories\n\nCombat\n\n\n\n\n\n›\n\nAimbot\n\nAim assistance with FOV, smoothing, target part, priority, and player or zombie targeting.\n\n\n\n›\n\nSilent Aim\n\nRedirects bullets to a target with hit chance, FOV, target filter, and visible-only check.\n\n\n\n›\n\nNo Bullet Spread\n\nEliminates bullet spread on all weapons. Available independently in Bullet Mods.\n\n\n\n›\n\nMovement Prediction\n\nLeads moving targets to compensate for bullet travel time.\n\n\n\n›\n\nBullet Drop Compensation\n\nAdjusts aim upward to account for projectile drop.\n\n\n\n›\n\nAuto Velocity Detection\n\nAutomatically detects muzzle velocity for the equipped weapon.\n\n\n\n›\n\nFOV Circles\n\nConfigurable FOV circles for aimbot and silent aim with color and transparency options.\n\n\n\n›\n\nHitbox Expander\n\nIncreases target hitbox size for easier hits.\n\n\n\n›\n\nWallbang\n\nBullets penetrate through walls and cover.\n\n\n\n›\n\nBullet Manipulation\n\nAutomatically shifts bullet origin to clear cover, with wallbang synergy and window awareness.\n\n\n\n›\n\nMelee Aura\n\nAuto-swings your equipped melee weapon at nearby zombies or players within a configurable range and speed.\n\n\n\n›\n\nNo Recoil\n\nRemoves weapon recoil.\n\n\n\n›\n\nInstant Reload\n\nRemoves reload time on all weapons.\n\n\n\n›\n\nUnlock Fire Modes\n\nEnables all fire modes on any firearm.\n\n\n\n›\n\nNo Fall Stun\n\nRemoves the stun after landing from a high fall.\n\n\n\n›\n\nDouble Jump\n\nJump again while in the air.\n\n\n\n›\n\nDesync\n\nShifts your visible position for a peek advantage.\n\n\n\n›\n\nTeam Check\n\nFilters squad members from all targeting features so you never target your own party.\n\nVisuals\n\n\n\n\n\n›\n\nPlayer ESP\n\nShows player names, distance, and equipped weapon through walls.\n\n\n\n›\n\nSquad ESP Display\n\nShow or hide squad members on ESP with separate color, fill, outline, and text transparency.\n\n\n\n›\n\nWeapon Info\n\nDisplays the weapon other players are holding on the ESP overlay.\n\n\n\n›\n\nZombie ESP\n\nTracks zombies with color and opacity options, and a boss-only filter.\n\n\n\n›\n\nVehicle ESP\n\nShows vehicle locations through walls.\n\n\n\n›\n\nLook Direction\n\nShows which direction each player is looking on the ESP overlay.\n\n\n\n›\n\nChams\n\nWall-visible character overlays with adjustable fill and outline transparency.\n\n\n\n›\n\nRandom Event ESP\n\nShows world event locations with labels and distance.\n\n\n\n›\n\nRandom Event Filter\n\nFilter which event types are shown or trigger notifications.\n\n\n\n›\n\nRandom Event Notifications\n\nGet notified when tracked world events spawn.\n\n\n\n›\n\nCorpse ESP\n\nTracks dead player corpses with name and distance.\n\n\n\n›\n\nMap Radar\n\nPins players, zombies, vehicles, and random events on the in-game map with configurable colors and toggles.\n\n\n\n›\n\nBullet Tracers\n\nVisual beams that follow your bullets with glow and rainbow options.\n\n\n\n›\n\nHit Log\n\nOn-screen feed showing hits with body part, damage, and server-confirmation status.\n\n\n\n›\n\nCharacter Visuals\n\nChange your character's material, color, and transparency.\n\n\n\n›\n\nWeapon Visuals\n\nChange your weapon's material and color.\n\n\n\n›\n\nVehicle Visuals\n\nChange your vehicle's material, color, and transparency.\n\n\n\n›\n\nCustom Crosshair\n\nFully configurable crosshair with outline, center dot, and color settings.\n\n\n\n›\n\nFreecam Tracer & Chams\n\nShows a line to your character and a glow around it while in freecam.\n\nUtility\n\n\n\n\n\n›\n\nSpectate\n\nWatch other players in first person, third person, or orbit mode.\n\n\n\n›\n\nSpectate HUD\n\nOverlay showing player info, weapon, and speed while spectating.\n\n\n\n›\n\nFirst Person Equipment Hiding\n\nHides gear models in first person spectate","tags":["op","free","no key","apocalypse","wallbang"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/UPRtgK6tEJ","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"696979e989eac87a14328699","username":"multy","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d18732c64f5b3ae1cac6af3aa091573d4d6a872824fc6668ed435d462aa4ee5d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696979e989eac87a143